刀，3 块钱左右。不担心隐私问题，那就找中转站，还能折价 50%</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122330\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1789083210\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:05:30 +08:00\">20h 21m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>小心翼翼不如不帮</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122339\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b26/8b1f/453614_normal.png?m=1763082552\" alt=\"Avedge\" data-uid=\"453614\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Avedge\">Avedge</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:06:12 +08:00\">20h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你说的朋友是不是你自己</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122377\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c71/db78/217315_normal.png?m=1789614238\" alt=\"Hconk\" data-uid=\"217315\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Hconk\">Hconk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:09:17 +08:00\">20h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看看那种网页版的 plus 合租，只用来提问没问题，也不贵</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123344\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6c0/dda5/561815_normal.png?m=1730962423\" alt=\"monmon\" data-uid=\"561815\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/monmon\">monmon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 11:54:17 +08:00\">18h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>在公网搭一个 opencode ，连接你的 GPT 订阅，让朋友用 opencode 网页就可以了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123514\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e098de2925c0d1de06070379e9117e1c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wfg\" data-uid=\"523454\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wfg\">wfg</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 12:39:58 +08:00\">17h 47m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让他自己研究去，你别瞎操心了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123519\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/eff4/53a7/313341_normal.png?m=1532421608\" alt=\"JinShu\" data-uid=\"313341\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JinShu\">JinShu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 12:41:44 +08:00\">17h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看问题深度